            <ArticleTitle>Endoscopic hand drill for management of tracheal stenosis.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1510/mmcts.2016.009</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We propose the use of a new endoscopic drill for management of web-like tracheal stenosis. Our device allows creating radial holes within stenosis that facilitates the use of the scissors for cutting the  scar and the subsequent mechanical dilatation.</AbstractText>
